        "kitchen_caption": "Every ingredient is processed on its own before anything is blended.",
        "origin_label": "The origin",
        "origin_heading": "A drinks pairing in London that never left the restaurant.",
        "origin_body": "<p>In 2017 Aaron Trotman was eating through Michelin-starred rooms in London. He took the alcohol pairing; the non-drinker at the table was handed something sweet and forgettable.</p><p>He had no background in drinks. He came from cosmetics chemistry, which turned out to matter more than a wine list would have. NON launched in 2019.</p>",
        "quote": "I thought it was a real shame that these drinks lived and died in fancy restaurants.",
        "quote_cite": "Aaron Trotman, founder",
        "proc_heading": "What we actually do",
        "proc_note": "Every glass is built from five things",
        "proc_blurb": "Nothing here is fermented and nothing is de-alcoholised. Every bottle is cooked — built from zero for the structure alcohol used to provide.",
        "proc_accent": "#d9576e",
        "pillars_label": "What we actually do",
        "pillars_heading": "Every glass is built from four things",
        "nots_label": "What we're not",
        "process_label": "The Process",
        "process_meta": "Six stages / 01—06",
