        "font_family": "",
        "text_scale": 100,
        "section_padding": 0,
        "hard_label": "The difficult part",
        "hard_heading": "Water doesn't carry flavour the way alcohol does.",
        "hard_body": "So every ingredient is processed on its own before anything is blended: cooked, steeped, sous-vide, roasted, dehydrated. It's slow, and it's the entire difference.",
        "who_label": "Who makes it",
        "who_body": "Chefs, food scientists, bartenders and winemakers — in-house.",
